Cover proc cmdline through a verified return probe

Adapt the missing /proc/cmdline coverage identified in inforcqb/susfs4ksu-for-lkm 3b0676dbc949494889238647f3f9516b452eb0e9 and KernelSU-Next 2baabd6090291849f52790fc5c8d24221417d761. Leave the __ro_after_init saved_command_line pointer untouched and rewrite only the proc seq_file output. Preserve overflow retry, clear original tails, reject failed probe registration, and retire shared strings through Tasks RCU.

Add host cases, fault-injection controls and ARM64 callback KCFI checks. Hardware validation is not claimed.
